{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Bounds","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.neg_ck_ne_kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.neg_ck_ne_kappa","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L110-L116","doc":"**Concrete: any negative `c_k` differs from every κ_n.** For a negative Q_β\ncoefficient `c < 0` and any of the four derived (positive) Ohtsuki rungs, the\ntwo are unequal — the universal sign obstruction of the honest negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.c2_ne_kappa1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.c2_ne_kappa1","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L103-L108","doc":"**Concrete: `c₂ = −1 ≠ κ₁` (sign).** The Lean-proved Q_β Taylor coefficient\n`c₂ = −1` is negative; the derived Ohtsuki `κ₁ = 11√3π/108` is positive; they\nare unequal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.no_real_rescaling_aligns","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.no_real_rescaling_aligns","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L92-L101","doc":"**No real rescaling aligns the tower with the ladder.** There is no real `λ`\nsimultaneously matching an odd rung to `c₂ < 0` and the next even rung to\n`c₃ < 0`: the even constraint `κ₂·λ² = c₃` alone is impossible for `κ₂ > 0`,\n`c₃ < 0`. (The first component is stated for faithfulness to the index-shifted\npairing κ₁↔c₂, κ₂↔c₃; the contradiction comes from the second.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.even_rung_positive_ne_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.even_rung_positive_ne_neg","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L79-L90","doc":"**Even-rung positivity kills any real rescaling (the core invariant).** A\npositive even Ohtsuki rung `κ` scaled by ANY real `λ` gives `κ·λ² ≥ 0`, so it\ncan never equal a negative Q_β coefficient `c < 0`. This is *why* no\nreparametrization `u ↦ λ·u` of the ladder variable can turn the all-positive\nκ-tower into the negative `c_k` — the even-power sign is reparametrization-\ninvariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa4_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa4_pos","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L74-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L71-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa2_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa2_pos","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L68-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa1_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa1_pos","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L65-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa4","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L62-L63","doc":"Ohtsuki `κ₄ = 98π⁴/729` (even rung). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa3","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L59-L60","doc":"Ohtsuki `κ₃ = 1081√3π³/21870` (odd rung). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa2","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L56-L57","doc":"Ohtsuki `κ₂ = 2π²/27` (even rung, ℚ·π²). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.kappa1","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/OhtsukiKappaVsCkSign.lean#L52-L54","doc":"Ohtsuki `κ₁ = 11√3π/108` (odd rung, ℚ(√3)·π). Derived from the 4₁ Kashaev\nsum; here as a closed real number. ","signatureChunk":0}]}